<title>UK: Laporte first half hit by exceptionals.</title>
<headline>Laporte first half hit by exceptionals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.9		    vs 24.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.5		    vs 8.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     36.4		   vs 67.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   577		    vs 552</p>
<p>NOTE - The specialty chemicals company said first-half results compared with a strong first half of 1995, and showed &quot;a significant advance&quot; on the second half of last year.</p>
<p>It said first half results were hit by a 23.9 million stg exceptional charge on the sale of businesses.</p>
</text>
